msgid "`PymooProblem`"
msgstr "`PymooProblem`"

#: ../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:14
msgid "A pymoo `Problem` (a benchmark, or existing research code)"
msgstr "pymooの`Problem`（ベンチマークや既存の研究コード）"

#: ../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:88
msgid "`PymooCrossover`/`PymooMutation` drop straight into `GA`:"
msgstr "`PymooCrossover`/`PymooMutation`は、そのまま`GA`に組み込めます。"

#: ../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:121
msgid ""
"`PymooAlgorithm` reuses a whole pymoo algorithm's own search and survival"
" logic, and `PymooProblem` reuses an existing pymoo problem definition "
"unchanged:"
msgstr "`PymooAlgorithm`はpymooアルゴリズム全体の探索・生存選択ロジックをそのまま再利用し、`PymooProblem`は既存のpymoo問題定義をそのまま再利用します。"

#: ../../tutorials/external_libraries.md:142
msgid ""
"`PymooAlgorithm` runs in \"engine mode\": the wrapped pymoo algorithm "
"owns its own population and internal survival state, and `ctx.population`"
" is refreshed from it after every generation rather than being the source"
" of truth. See [Algorithm](../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md) "
"for what this means in practice (no checkpoint/resume, `n_offspring` is "
"ignored, and `PreSelectionStrategy`'s partial `tell()` needs an explicit "
"opt-in)."
msgstr "`PymooAlgorithm`は「エンジンモード」で動作します。ラップしたpymooアルゴリズムが自身の個体群と内部の生存選択状態を保持し、`ctx.population`は基準となるデータではなく、各世代後にそこから更新されます。実際の意味（チェックポイントと再開には非対応、`n_offspring`は無視される、`PreSelectionStrategy`の部分的な`tell()`には明示的なオプトインが必要）については[Algorithm](../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md)を参照してください。"

